#. type: Plain text
#, fuzzy, no-wrap
#| msgid ""
#| "<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
#| "The following jobs use [Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives). Both `SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` take one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple observables and parameters. Each PUB returns a result.\n"
#| "</Admonition>\n"
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"The following jobs use IBM Quantum V2 primitives. Both `SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` take one or more primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as the input. Each PUB is a tuple that contains one circuit and the data broadcasted to that circuit, which can be multiple observables and parameters. Each PUB returns a result.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"以下のジョブでは[Qiskit Runtime V2 primitives](/guides/v2-primitives)を使用しています。`SamplerV2`と`EstimatorV2`はどちらも、1つ以上のPrimitive Unified Bloc（PUB）を入力として受け取ります。各PUBは1つのサーキットと、そのサーキットにブロードキャストされるデータ（複数のオブザーバブルやパラメーターを含む場合があります）を格納したタプルです。各PUBは結果を1つ返します。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

